# Fixed defect 2692, 2026-11-22, lane-crossing, a shape beside it: the send
# stands in a module that is neither the root nor the one declaring the type
# it sends. Symptom: the verdict on `sender.hero`'s one line moved with the
# module the send stood in and with the root the program was compiled from.
# Cause: the record's fields were lowered only once the declarations' walk
# reached its module, and the walk takes every module's declarations as one
# list, in an order the root decides (spec § 11).
use sender

function main()
    print(sender.go())
